Package: ItemanalTools
Title: Tools for Item-Level Statistical Analysis in Psychometrics
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Cesar", "Merino Soto", email = "sikayax@yahoo.com.ar", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collection of tools for analyzing items in psychological and educational scales from a expanded focus and mainly nonparametric approach. Methods include analysis of item response similarity, evaluation of group effects, and other item-level statistical procedures used in psychometrics.
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    PMCMRplus,
    rcompanion,
    stats,
    ordinal,
    boot,
    psych
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
